	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p19_dancer_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたが　リーダー！
アネゴは　サブリーダー！▽
さあ！　みんなで　おどろうぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:05:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T05:58:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたが　リーダー！
アネゴは　サブリーダー！▽
さあ！　みんなで　踊ろうぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:28:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T05:58:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・全員に勝利後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T05:58:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>DANCER
トレーナーID：dancer_08</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T05:58:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:36:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p19_guitarw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたいの　かわいい　こぶんを
かなしい　キモチに　させやがって▼
ばいがえしで　あんたを　もっともっと
かなしい　キモチに　させるよ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:29:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T11:04:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたいの　可愛い　子分を
悲しい　キモチに　させやがって▼
倍返しで　あんたを　もっともっと
悲しい　キモチに　させるよ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:29:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T11:04:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・３人目
・GRIDX＝18、GRIDZ＝3
・戦闘前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T05:08:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MUSICIANW
トレーナーID：guitarw_04</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T05:09:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:36:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p19_guitarw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まったく　あんたって　やつは……
メダルに　ふさわしいね▼
きめたよ！
あんたが　ここの　リーダーさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:06:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T11:04:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まったく　あんたって　やつは……
メダルに　ふさわしいね▼
決めたよ！
あんたが　ここの　リーダーさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:29:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T11:04:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・戦闘後
・メダル入手条件ON</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T05:08:31" />
		</CommentCell>
